v 3
d dotemp: module to create a formatted do-file header template
d
d  dotemp downloads a do-file template and inserts a formatted
d  header block containing the title, project, purpose, author,
d  contact, and creation/modification dates. Intended to
d  standardize do-file headers across a project or team.
d
d Author: Arman Mahmud
d Support: email armanmahmud.du18@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260920
d
